        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Victoria Island and the Arrayanes Forest"
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_text:936a34ccc6e7c635",
      "field": "itinerary.text",
      "sourceTextSha256": "93733f33928fc8e700279eeeeb7388217611197c9e4d54a3c90c2229786c2048",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-a769ac8379f2d25c8c252a41",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "The catamaran trip takes about **3 hours**, and you'll be travelling with other visitors.\n\nYou'll visit Victoria Island, the largest island in Lake Nahuel Huapi. Several lagoons on the island are home to cormorants, pheasants and peacocks.\n\nThe second part of the excursion takes you to the Arrayanes Forest, known for its large myrtle trees with bright orange trunks. The green grass and the deep colour of the lake stand out along the walk.\n\nAfter the boat trip, return to Bariloche."
    },
    {
      "blockId": "tour:itinerary_label:fca71ba00e3a58fc",
      "field": "itinerary.label",
      "sourceTextSha256": "70e0b8d94d14bbfa360a6ce8e42ee41ad26b8cd98b9fdd902c038613dfbf06ba",
      "provenance": {
        "kind": "ai_translation",
        "runId": "ada-en-20261109-a769ac8379f2d25c8c252a41",
        "model": "GPT-6"
      },
      "text": "Victoria Island (Lake Nahuel Huapi)"
    },
    {
